{"updated_at": {"date": {"d": "29", "m": "08", "Y": "2026"}, "time": {"H": "04", "M": "37", "S": "57"}}, "news": [{"title": "Nagpur civic body seizes properties of tax defaulters in recovery drive", "para": "The Nagpur Municipal Corporation has escalated its property tax collection efforts, resulting in the recovery of Rs 1.51 crore and the seizure of several properties from defaulters. This initiative is part of a broader campaign aiming to recover a staggering Rs 1,000 crore in pending property taxes, targeting primarily commercial properties and major offenders.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/regulatory/nagpur-civic-body-seizes-properties-of-tax-defaulters-in-recovery-drive/133603720?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-142270/133603720.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "regulatory"}, {"title": "Haryana RERA orders Ansal Phalak Infrastructure to pay 10.8% interest for flat handover delay", "para": "Gurgaon Rera ordered Ansal Phalak Infrastructure to pay delayed possession interest.  Homebuyers booked a flat in Esencia project in Sector 67 over a decade ago.  The developer was to complete construction within 36 months, with a grace period.  The authority computed the prescribed interest rate as 10.8% per annum.  The promoter failed to hand over possession within the stipulated timeline.", "href": "https://realty.economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/rera/haryana-rera-orders-ansal-phalak-infrastructure-to-pay-10-8-interest-for-flat-handover-delay/133603596?utm_source=newslisting&utm_medium=latestNews", "img": "data:image/png;base64, ", "img-src": "https://etimg.etb2bimg.com/thumb/img-size-87656/133603596.cms?width=150&height=112", "tag": "rera"}, {"title": "Lucky draws for 8,000 LIG flats in Hyderabad begin; to continue till August 31", "para": "In Hyderabad, the lucky draw for Indiramma Towers flats unfolded in four key constituencies, handing